t/issues/104688","id":2757569904,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kXS1w","user":{"login":"elvisish","id":16231628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjMxNjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16231628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish","html_url":"https://github.com/elvisish","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T10:44:28Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T10:44:28Z","body":"> To confirm, this has been confirmed as not being a bug with the add-on? It is compatible with 4.5?\n\nI'm trying to determine this, hopefully the addon developer will be able to confirm this on their github issues, but since that hasn't changed between 4.4 and 4.5, the problem is definitely caused by the new version of Godot. The addon hasn't been updated in a while, but it's never had this problem before 4.5, and as a workaround you can manually press save before running, but it is inconvenient if you forget since eveything else autosaves.\n\nIs there anything that could have changed between 4.4 and 4.5 that might be causing this?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2757569904/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2757585702","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104688#issuecomment-2757585702","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104688","id":2757585702,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kXWsm","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T10:50:32Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T10:50:32Z","body":"Add-ons aren't necessarily guaranteed to work with zero changes between updates, we try to minimize compatibility changes but some adjustments are often necessary, so generally it's best to confirm that it *is* a problem on the engine side before reporting, this could be a simple issue of the add-on not using the engine features correctly, though I can't say without knowing the code of the add-on\n\nProbably related to:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90034\n\nBut can't tell without knowing more, my suspicion is that the add-on doesn't correctly use the undo/redo system, does it correctly show the unsaved marker `(*)` when changes are made? If not then this is a problem with the add-on not using the editor features correctly\n\nBut please confirm with the add-on creators and update here when you've got some updates","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2757585702/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848502404","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104688#issuecomment-2848502404","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104688","id":2848502404,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pyLKE","user":{"login":"elvisish","id":16231628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjMxNjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16231628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish","html_url":"https://github.com/elvisish","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-03T08:08:50Z","updated_at":"2025-05-03T08:08:50Z","body":"> Add-ons aren't necessarily guaranteed to work with zero changes between updates, we try to minimize compatibility changes but some adjustments are often necessary, so generally it's best to confirm that it *is* a problem on the engine side before reporting, this could be a simple issue of the add-on not using the engine features correctly, though I can't say without knowing the code of the add-on\n> \n> Probably related to:\n> * https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90034\n> \n> But can't tell without knowing more, my suspicion is that the add-on doesn't correctly use the undo/redo system, does it correctly show the unsaved marker `(*)` when changes are made? If not then this is a problem with the add-on not using the editor features correctly\n> \n> But please confirm with the add-on creators and update here when you've got some updates\n\n@codecat might be able suggest something, it's a C++ extension and unfortunately I don't know how the plugin works internally. If save before run was changed though, that might partly explain the issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848502404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3915254838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104688#issuecomment-3915254838","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104688","id":3915254838,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pXgw2","user":{"login":"elvisish","id":16231628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjMxNjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16231628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish","html_url":"https://github.com/elvisish","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisish/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elvisis